{"id":487,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"三期制とキャリア学習で成長を支える平塚中等","feature_description":"神奈川県立平塚中等教育学校は、6年間を「基礎・観察期」「充実・発見期」「発展・伸長期」の三期に分けて学びを進めます。前期課程では国語・数学・英語を基本的に毎日学び、基礎を確実に身につけます。体験・探究活動やキャリア学習を通じ、表現コミュニケーション力、科学・論理的思考力、社会生活実践力を育てます。かながわ次世代教養では、伝統文化・地球環境・英語コミュニケーション・IT活用を学びます。","clubs":[{"id":9679,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/hiratsuka-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatsudousyokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9680,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/hiratsuka-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatsudousyokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9681,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/hiratsuka-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatsudousyokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9682,"name":"山岳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/hiratsuka-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatsudousyokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9683,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/hiratsuka-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatsudousyokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9684,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/hiratsuka-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatsudousyokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9685,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/hiratsuka-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatsudousyokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9686,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/hiratsuka-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatsudousyokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9687,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/hiratsuka-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatsudousyokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9688,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/hiratsuka-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatsudousyokai.html","verified_at":"2026-11-1